BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Burlington Baroque Festival: Handel’s Oratorio Israel In Egypt
DTSTART:20260920T140000
DTEND:20260920T153000
DTSTAMP:20260920T144436Z
UID:44e161339a12bdba60e3bc203d00c6@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:BURLINGTON BAROQUE FESTIVAL Thursday\, September 17th thru Sun
 day\, September 20th\, 2026 College Street Congregational Church\, Burling
 ton The Cathedral Church of St. Paul\, Burlington The University of Vermon
 t Recital Hall\, Burlington Burlington Baroque presents five performances 
 featuring internationally acclaimed Artists-in-Residence L’Harmonie des 
 saisons Baroque Orchestra\, Boston’s Blue Heron Renaissance Ensemble\, a
 nd the Burlington Baroque Festival Singers. The Third Annual BURLINGTON BA
 ROQUE FESTIVAL under the direction of Eric Milnes will feature a wondrous 
 array of glorious repertoire offered by a renowned ensemble of specialists
  performing in historically informed style and on the period baroque instr
 uments for which the music was written. Our festival Artists-in-Residence
 \, who are regularly featured in festival performances across North Americ
 a\, Europe\, South America and Asia\, will be gathered in Burlington for t
 he week and will be joined by the Burlington Baroque Festival Singers\, an
 d Boston’s Blue Heron Ensemble for five spectacular performances at thre
 e Burlington venues\, from Thursday\, September 17th through Sunday\, Sept
 ember 20th\, 2026. Don’t miss this opportunity to hear the great reperto
 ire of the Baroque period with an award winning Baroque Orchestra\, intern
 ationally acclaimed vocal soloists and the Burlington Baroque Festival Sin
 gers\, offering listeners a rare opportunity to experience this incredible
  music anew - and from a fresh perspective. Sunday\, September 20th\, 2:00
  p.m. Oratorio: Israel in Egypt George Frideric Handel The University of V
 ermont Recital Hall A co-production with The Lane Series Adults $40-$80\, 
 $10 Student\, Children free\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:UVM Recital Hall\, 384 So. Prospect St.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/burlington
 -baroque-festival-handels-oratorio-israel-in-egypt-17-08-2026-00-54-35
END:VEVENT
