UID:7112866a1441d1efbaf842b8c9c201@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join Bloom Lab Perfumerie at Maquam Barn & Winery in Milton fo
 r an afternoon of botanical perfumery\, creativity\, and wine. You'll expl
 ore the art of natural perfumery\, smell your way through a beautiful pale
 tte of botanical ingredients\, and be guided through the process of creati
 ng a custom Eau de Parfum that's entirely your own. No perfume-making expe
 rience necessary. Just bring your curiosity—and maybe a friend. 🍷 You
 'll leave with your very own 30 mL botanical perfume\, hand-blended by you
 .\n\nSources: Vermont Public
