DTSTART:20260920T120000
DTEND:20260920T160000
DTSTAMP:20260920T144436Z
UID:577a2119a819a802e887cd0aca7771@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Come for the weekend and make a difference in the lives of res
 cue animals. Spend the weekend helping us prep for Winter\, maintaining an
 d building fencing\, planting daffodils\, clearing brush\, pitchforking ma
 nure (important and necessary work)\, hoof trimming\, painting\, and every
 thing in between. Watch the sunset from the Big Sky Tent Deck on the Equin
 ox. Sit around campfires with new friends. Eat great food -- we'll make yo
 u dinner each evening!\n\nSources: Vermont Public
